  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOLD - Growth Oriented Local Development - Growth Oriented Local Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GOLD Project with USAID</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det l&#xe5;ngsiktiga m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r GOLD &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka de ekonomiska m&#xf6;jligheterna f&#xf6;r medborgare i Bosnien och Hercegovina. Projektet avser att &#xf6;ka  illv&#xe4;xtorienterade ekonomiska aktiviteter i de utvalda omr&#xe5;dena i    landet under de fem &#xe5;r projektet ber&#xe4;knas l&#xf6;pa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The long-term goal of GOLD is to expand economic opportunity for citizens in BiH. The purpose of the Project is to increase the level  of growth-oriented economic activity in selected localities in BiH during the estimated five-year life of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Growth-Oriented Local Development Program (GOLD) is to increase economic opportunities for BiH citizens. The purpose of the Program is to increase level of growth-oriented economic activity in selected localities.</narrative>
  </description>
